Hi Jeffrey,

Thank you for your questions and apologies for the lack of clarity.

I am running two separate occupancy models for both species, looking at season effect on detection with NDVI, light pollution and population size for occupancy.

Models in r so far:
occu(formula = ~1 ~ NDVI + Light + Pop_Size, data = coyotedep2_umf)
occu(formula = ~1 ~ NDVI + Light + Pop_Size, data = bobcatdep1_umf)

